# Public export: exact files only; unlisted additions remain private.
# Source: game branch base; no history, credentials, local dependencies or generated state.
# coordinator source/config/tests stay, except the recorded decision corpus pending owner choice:
# train and extra are recursively read; size/privacy constraints need a separate corpus decision.
# scripts: build, install, verification, test and quality entrypoints stay.
# quality bench/launchers and feel are private deployment experiments (AUDIT: host paths/SSH).
# Savepoint generators, usage backfill and recorded validation results are run records, excluded.
# ops, notes, evals, reports, PROJECT_LOG and other docs stay private; no records are moved.
# libs: provenance and checksum manifests only; upstream binaries fetched by fetch-libs.sh.
# gradle wrapper JAR is build infrastructure, not a libs dependency.
# docs/gates excluded: recorded usage; stake formatter reports no product numbers without reports.
# runtime/README stays because the source runtime instructions link it.
# maps/server-template/voice-addon stay as build and distribution inputs.
# This manifest is intentionally verbose: each newly added file requires explicit inclusion.
.github/workflows/decision-eval.yml
.github/workflows/reliability.yml
.gitignore
